      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not exactly",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0074002000650078006100630074006C00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Something like that",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006D0065007400680069006E00670020006C0069006B0065002000740068006100740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm. Well, in any case, do you think you could\nhelp me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D002E002000570065006C006C002C00200069006E00200061006E007900200063006100730065002C00200064006F00200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B00200079006F007500200063006F0075006C0064000A00680065006C00700020006D0065003F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I let my darling Klefki hold all of my most\nimportant keys.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006C006500740020006D00790020006400610072006C0069006E00670020004B006C00650066006B006900200068006F006C006400200061006C006C0020006F00660020006D00790020006D006F00730074000A0069006D0070006F007200740061006E00740020006B006500790073002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But it seems Klefki dropped one of them on our\nlast outing together...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Any idea where?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E007900200069006400650061002000770068006500720065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Where did you go?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006500720065002000640069006400200079006F007500200067006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me think... Oh yes, we went to a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>hair salon<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!\nBut it was my first time visiting that place, so I<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndon’t recall the exact location.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I was so pleased with my new look that I decided\nwe would have an elegant brunch at a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>café<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> near<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe hair salon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then another patron of the café challenged me to\na battle, so we went to the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>battle court <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>out back.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI won a magnificent victory, naturally.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I could just remember which hair salon it was,\nI’m sure I could retrace my steps...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In any case—I entrust finding my key to you, my\ndearest detective’s assistant.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The day I lost my key, I went to a hair salon, then a\ncafé, and finally to a battle court behind the café.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf I may be so bold, might I suggest looking for a\nhair salon that has a café nearby?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 200
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You found a fancy key!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200066006F0075006E006400200061002000660061006E006300790020006B0065007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂r.iss Assistant! I just remembered I had my battle\nin this very battle court!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! And you found my key!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002100200041006E006400200079006F007500200066006F0075006E00640020006D00790020006B00650079002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ki ki...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
