      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00690020006B0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, my poor Klefki... It’s not your fault the key was\nlost. I’m the one who decided to battle here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ki ki?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00690020006B0069003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I do recall hearing that Klefki never let go of\nthe keys they like...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, how about this: from now on, you’ll only have\nto hold the keys you like.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll handle any other keys myself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000680061006E0064006C006500200061006E00790020006F00740068006500720020006B0065007900730020006D007900730065006C0066002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ki ki! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00690020006B006900210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That means we’re going to be sharing some key\nresponsibilities, my darling Klefki!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much, M<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂r.iss Assistant. Please, take\nthis as a sign of my gratitude.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
